---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms of Service — Ramia Studio" lang="en">
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 min-h-[70vh]">
    <article class="prose prose-neutral prose-sm sm:prose-base mx-auto font-body text-neutral-600 space-y-6">
      
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl text-neutral-900 mb-8 font-light">Terms of Service</h1>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-neutral-900 mt-8 mb-4">1. Shipping</h2>
      <p>All national orders (Spain Peninsula) are processed in our atelier and delivered within 24/48 working hours after preparation.</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-neutral-900 mt-8 mb-4">2. Returns</h2>
      <p>You have 14 calendar days from receipt of the piece to exercise your right of withdrawal, provided the product is unused and in its original packaging.</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-neutral-900 mt-8 mb-4">3. Warranties</h2>
      <p>Our pieces are handcrafted with high-quality acrylic and anti-allergic fittings (surgical steel/titanium). Due to their manual nature, they may present slight variations that make them unique.</p>
  
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>